dren_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十四、徐州（卷二十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"魏收《志》：吕县有吕梁城，碛泉盖在吕梁之东。陈大建七年，...","context_before":"...弃船步走，魏将尉元与薛安都前后邀击，大破永等于吕梁之东。","source_end_index":266,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8814025b-d212-5d21-8a25-99c5b61e8cd5","source_start_index":244,"source_text":"梁太清初，萧弄璋攻东魏碛泉、吕梁二戍，拔之。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/十四、徐州（卷二十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"27戊子，武州刺史蕭弄璋攻東魏磧泉、呂梁二戍，拔之。","content_fanyi":"戊子日，武州刺史萧弄璋进攻东魏的碛泉、吕梁两处戍所，并将其攻克。","content_jianti_auto":"27戊子，武州刺史萧弄璋攻东魏碛泉、吕梁二戍，拔之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":15088,"number":27,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百六十 (梁紀十六) / 高祖武皇帝十六 / 太清元年 / 第 39 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"af8c9d0a-db0e-11ef-9dba-a0d3651f611f","year_int":547},"tongjian_id":"af8c9d0a-db0e-11ef-9dba-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"呂梁","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"呂梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"吕梁","place_note":"石梁，安徽省天长市西","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b297ff74-db0e-11ef-adcf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"彭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"彭城","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b297ff75-db0e-11ef-8c5c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"石梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"石梁","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b297ff76-db0e-11ef-9e4a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"呂梁在彭城，疑此卽石梁。","note_content_jianti_auto":"吕梁在彭城，疑此即石梁。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"b297ff73-db0e-11ef-8417-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"銑，蘇典翻。鋧，他典翻。類篇曰：銑鋧，小鑿也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"铣，苏典翻。鋧，他典翻。类篇曰：铣鋧，小凿也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":168,"tongjian_id":"b297ff7b-db0e-11ef-bb96-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"破胡","people_name_jianti_auto":"破胡","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b297ff7f-db0e-11ef-94b6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：北齊書，破胡敗在五月。今從齊書。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：北齐书，破胡败在五月。今从齐书。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":206,"tongjian_id":"b297ff7e-db0e-11ef-b35f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b297ff72-db0e-11ef-8ffd-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"gòu","source_anchor_text":"前十餘步彀弓未發摩","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":156,"text":"彀","tongjian_id":"4449683c-57c4-5a26-ae97-9bf502e7ff38"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b297ff72-db0e-11ef-8ffd-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"xǐ","source_anchor_text":"摩訶遙擲銑鋧正中其","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":165,"text":"銑","tongjian_id":"74fdd6ce-d7cd-5608-a607-e470044f3c76"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b297ff72-db0e-11ef-8ffd-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"xiàn","source_anchor_text":"訶遙擲銑鋧正中其額","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":166,"text":"鋧","tongjian_id":"0ff0860c-890b-55e1-99b5-8d8185adefd6"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"呂梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"吕梁","place_note":"石梁，安徽省天长市西","resolved_place_entity_id":2386,"start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"b297ff85-db0e-11ef-86e1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"齊師選長大有膂力者爲前隊，又有蒼頭、犀角、大力，其鋒甚銳，又有西域胡，善射，弦無虛發，衆軍尤憚之。辛酉，戰于呂梁。將戰，吳明徹謂巴山太守蕭摩訶曰：「若殪此胡，則彼軍奪氣，君才不減關羽矣。」摩訶曰：「願示其狀，當爲公取之。」明徹乃召降人有識胡者，使指示之，自酌酒以飲摩訶。摩訶飲畢，馳馬衝齊軍。胡挺身出陳前十餘步，彀弓未發，摩訶遙擲銑鋧，正中其額，應手而仆。齊軍大力十餘人出戰，摩訶又斬之。於是齊軍大敗，尉破胡走，長孫洪略戰死。","content_fanyi":"北齐军队挑选身材高大、有勇力的人充当前队，又设有苍头、犀角、大力等骁勇分队，锋芒非常锐利，又招募有西域胡兵，善于射箭，弦无虚发，陈朝各支部队都非常惧怕他们。四月二十六日辛酉，双方在吕梁交战。将要开战时，吴明彻对巴山太守萧摩诃说：“如果您一举杀死这个胡兵，敌军就会丧失锐气，您的才能不亚于关羽。”萧摩诃说：“希望您告诉我他的相貌，我一定替您取他性命。”吴明彻于是叫来认识这个胡兵的北齐降兵，让他指给萧摩诃看，并亲自斟酒递给萧摩诃喝。萧摩诃喝完酒，策马直冲北齐军阵。胡兵挺身冲出军阵十余步，刚拉满弓还未放箭，萧摩诃从远处投出小铁矛，正中他的额头，胡兵应手扑倒在地。北齐军中大力队的十几名胡人大力士出阵接战，萧摩诃又将他们斩杀。于是北齐军大败，尉破胡逃走，长孙洪略战死。","content_jianti_auto":"齐师选长大有膂力者为前队，又有苍头、犀角、大力，其锋甚锐，又有西域胡，善射，弦无虚发，众军尤惮之。辛酉，战于吕梁。将战，吴明彻谓巴山太守萧摩诃曰：「若殪此胡，则彼军夺气，君才不减关羽矣。」摩诃曰：「愿示其状，当为公取之。」明彻乃召降人有识胡者，使指示之，自酌酒以饮摩诃。摩诃饮毕，驰马冲齐军。胡挺身出陈前十余步，彀弓未发，摩诃遥掷铣鋧，正中其额，应手而仆。齐军大力十余人出战，摩诃又斩之。于是齐军大败，尉破胡走，长孙洪略战死。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":16459,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七十一 (陳紀五) / 高宗宣皇帝上之下 / 五年 / 第 21 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b297ff72-db0e-11ef-8ffd-a0d3651f611f","year_int":573},"tongjian_id":"b297ff72-db0e-11ef-8ffd-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"呂梁","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"呂梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"吕梁","place_note":"徐州市东南","resolved_place_entity_id":2386,"start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"b2cd0f95-db0e-11ef-8905-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十四、徐州（卷二十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"九年，因周人灭齐，复命明彻攻彭城，为周将王轨所败。隋唐以...","context_before":"...年，侯景以河南州镇来附，诏萧渊明等攻彭城，为景援，败还。","source_end_index":572,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"0131a257-44d0-541f-a6ae-5a30147cf25c","source_start_index":555,"source_text":"陈大建七年，吴明彻攻齐彭城，不克。"},{"context_after":"十年，明彻伐周，进屯吕梁，周徐州总管梁士彦拒战，为明彻所...","context_before":"...二戍，拔之。魏收《志》：吕县有吕梁城，碛泉盖在吕梁之东。","source_end_index":311,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8814025b-d212-5d21-8a25-99c5b61e8cd5","source_start_index":288,"source_text":"陈大建七年，吴明彻攻彭城，大破齐军数万于吕梁。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/十四、徐州（卷二十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"19閏月，車騎大將軍吳明徹將兵擊齊彭城；壬辰，敗齊兵數萬於呂梁。","content_fanyi":"闰九月，陈朝车骑大将军吴明彻率军攻打北齐彭城；闰九月十一日壬辰，吴明彻在吕梁击败数万齐兵。","content_jianti_auto":"19闰月，车骑大将军吴明彻将兵击齐彭城；壬辰，败齐兵数万于吕梁。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":16570,"number":19,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七十二 (陳紀六) / 高宗宣皇帝中之上 / 太建七年 / 第 36 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"b2cd0f8f-db0e-11ef-ac50-a0d3651f611f","year_int":575},"tongjian_id":"b2cd0f8f-db0e-11ef-ac50-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"呂梁","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"禹","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b2fff357-db0e-11ef-b78c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"徐","place_name_jianti_auto":"徐","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b2fff358-db0e-11ef-8d24-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"兗","place_name_jianti_auto":"兖","place_note":"府设瑕丘【山东省兖州市】","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b2fff359-db0e-11ef-8ac2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"海岱","place_name_jianti_auto":"海岱","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b2fff35a-db0e-11ef-a71e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"b2fff35b-db0e-11ef-85d7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"徐州","place_name_jianti_auto":"徐州","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"b2fff35c-db0e-11