,"place_name_jianti_auto":"泗水郡","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"b2fff36d-db0e-11ef-b791-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"b2fff36e-db0e-11ef-95c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"沛郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"沛郡","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"b2fff36f-db0e-11ef-87fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚國","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚国","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"b2fff370-db0e-11ef-87af-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"徐州","place_name_jianti_auto":"徐州","start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"b2fff371-db0e-11ef-854d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"徐州","place_name_jianti_auto":"徐州","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"b2fff372-db0e-11ef-b19a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"彭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"彭城","start_index":108,"tongjian_id":"b2fff373-db0e-11ef-a8b8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此言禹迹徐、兗二州之地。禹貢曰：海岱及淮惟徐州，濟河惟兗州。周之九州，青州得沂、泗、淮三水，兗州得大野，無復徐州矣。今之徐州，春秋宋地，左傳圍宋彭城是也。秦屬泗水郡；漢屬沛郡，後分立楚國，後置徐州。自是之後，徐州專治彭城矣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此言禹迹徐、兖二州之地。禹贡曰：海岱及淮惟徐州，济河惟兖州。周之九州，青州得沂、泗、淮三水，兖州得大野，无复徐州矣。今之徐州，春秋宋地，左传围宋彭城是也。秦属泗水郡；汉属沛郡，后分立楚国，后置徐州。自是之后，徐州专治彭城矣。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b2fff356-db0e-11ef-8d34-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"呂梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"吕梁","place_note":"江苏省徐州市东南二十公里","resolved_place_entity_id":2386,"start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"b2fff381-db0e-11ef-949d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十四、徐州（卷二十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"隋唐以后，州郡皆治彭城县。元省县入州。《城邑考》：州外城...","context_before":"...攻彭城，为景援，败还。陈大建七年，吴明彻攻齐彭城，不克。","source_end_index":597,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"0131a257-44d0-541f-a6ae-5a30147cf25c","source_start_index":572,"source_text":"九年，因周人灭齐，复命明彻攻彭城，为周将王轨所败。"},{"context_after":"盖吕梁自晋宋间有之。或谓唐武德中，尉迟敬德开此洪，假龙门...","context_before":"...吕梁之东。陈大建七年，吴明彻攻彭城，大破齐军数万于吕梁。","source_end_index":387,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8814025b-d212-5d21-8a25-99c5b61e8cd5","source_start_index":311,"source_text":"十年，明彻伐周，进屯吕梁，周徐州总管梁士彦拒战，为明彻所败，进围彭城，环列舟舰于城下，堰泗水以灌城，周遣王轨驰救，募壮士夜决堰，至明，陈人始觉，遂溃还。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/十四、徐州（卷二十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"9上聞周人滅齊，欲爭徐、兗，詔南兗州刺史、司空吳明徹督諸軍伐之，以其世子戎昭、將軍惠覺攝行州事。明徹軍至呂梁，周徐州總管梁士彥帥衆拒戰，戊午，明徹擊破之。士彥嬰城自守，明徹圍之。","content_fanyi":"陈宣帝得知北周灭亡北齐，想与北周争夺徐州、兖州，于是下诏命南兖州刺史、司空吴明彻统率诸军前往征讨，并让他的世子吴戎昭与将军惠觉代理州中政务。吴明彻的军队进至吕梁，北周徐州总管梁士彦率众迎战，戊午日，吴明彻击败了他。梁士彦环城固守，吴明彻率军将其包围。","content_jianti_auto":"9上闻周人灭齐，欲争徐、兖，诏南兖州刺史、司空吴明彻督诸军伐之，以其世子戎昭、将军惠觉摄行州事。明彻军至吕梁，周徐州总管梁士彦帅众拒战，戊午，明彻击破之。士彦婴城自守，明彻围之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":16681,"number":9,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七十三 (陳紀七) / 高宗宣皇帝中之下 / 太建九年 / 第 40 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"b2fff355-db0e-11ef-956f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":577},"tongjian_id":"b2fff355-db0e-11ef-956f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"呂梁","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"徐州","place_name_jianti_auto":"徐州","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c6d510ea-db0e-11ef-be62-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"彭城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"彭城县","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c6d510eb-db0e-11ef-b551-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"呂梁洪鎭","place_name_jianti_auto":"吕梁洪镇","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c6d510ec-db0e-11ef-9fde-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"九域志：徐州彭城縣有呂梁洪鎭。","note_content_jianti_auto":"九域志：徐州彭城县有吕梁洪镇。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"c6d510e9-db0e-11ef-b431-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"呂梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"吕梁","place_note":"江苏省徐州市东南","resolved_place_entity_id":2386,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"c6d510f1-db0e-11ef-a7ec-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十四、徐州（卷二十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"光化二年，杨行密讨朱全忠，进攻彭城，军于吕梁，不克而还。...","context_before":"...武德中，尉迟敬德开此洪，假龙门吕梁，以状此水之险，误矣。","source_end_index":466,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8814025b-d212-5d21-8a25-99c5b61e8cd5","source_start_index":428,"source_text":"龙纪初，朱全忠将庞师古攻时溥于徐州，拔宿预军于吕梁，溥逆战，大败，退保彭城。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/十四、徐州（卷二十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3汴將龐師古拔宿遷，軍于呂梁。時溥逆戰，大敗，還保彭城。","content_fanyi":"汴州将领庞师古攻占宿迁，驻军于吕梁。时溥迎战，大败，退回彭城坚守。","content_jianti_auto":"3汴将庞师古拔宿迁，军于吕梁。时溥逆战，大败，还保彭城。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":26510,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百五十八 (唐紀七十四) / 昭宗聖穆景文孝皇帝上之上 / 龍紀元年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"c6d510e8-db0e-11ef-8120-a0d3651f611f","year_int":889},"tongjian_id":"c6d510e8-db0e-11ef-8120-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"呂梁","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"呂梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"吕梁","place_note":"江苏徐州市东南","resolved_place_entity_id":2386,"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"c7b557f0-db0e-11ef-9eac-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十四、徐州（卷二十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宋元祐四年，京东转运使言：清河与江、浙、淮南诸路相通，因...","context_before":"...古攻时溥于徐州，拔宿预军于吕梁，溥逆战，大败，退保彭城。","source_end_index":494,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8814025b-d212-5d21-8a25-99c5b61e8cd5","source_start_index":466,"source_text":"光化二年，杨行密讨朱全忠，进攻彭城，军于吕梁，不克而还。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/十四、徐州（卷二十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3楊行密與朱瑾將兵數萬攻徐州，軍于呂梁，朱全忠遣騎將張歸厚救之。","content_fanyi":"杨行密与朱瑾率领数万军队攻打徐州，驻扎在吕梁，朱全忠派遣骑兵将领张归厚前去救援徐州。","content_jianti_auto":"3杨行密与朱瑾将兵数万攻徐州，军于吕梁，朱全忠遣骑将张归厚救之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":27023,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百六十一 (唐紀七十七) / 昭宗聖穆景文孝皇帝中之上 / 二年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"c7b557ea-db0e-11ef-90e7-a0d3651f611f","year_int":899},"tongjian_id":"c7b557ea-db0e-11ef-90e7-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":7},"place_name":"呂梁"},"message":"success","success":true}